@startuml common_boot
title Common boot & connectivity (shared by all boards)

actor "Power on" as PWR
participant "app_main()" as APP
participant "wifi_sta" as WIFI
participant "AP / Router" as AP
participant "mqtt_wrap\n(esp-mqtt)" as MQTT
participant "MQTT broker\n(RPi / Mosquitto)" as BROKER
participant "Home Assistant" as HA
participant "board on_connect()" as BOARD

PWR -> APP: reset
APP -> WIFI: wifi_sta_start(hostname)
WIFI -> WIFI: nvs_flash_init()\nnetif + event loop
WIFI -> AP: esp_wifi_connect()
AP --> WIFI: IP_EVENT_STA_GOT_IP
note right of WIFI: s_connected = true

APP -> MQTT: mqtt_start(board, on_msg, on_conn)
MQTT -> BROKER: CONNECT\n(LWT: home/<board>/status = "offline", retain)
BROKER --> MQTT: MQTT_EVENT_CONNECTED
MQTT -> BROKER: publish home/<board>/status = "online" (retain)
MQTT -> BOARD: on_connect()
BOARD -> BROKER: subscribe command topic(s)
BOARD -> BROKER: publish homeassistant/.../config (retained discovery)
BROKER -> HA: discovery + availability
HA -> HA: entities appear online

... connection lost ...
MQTT -x BROKER: TCP drop
BROKER -> HA: LWT home/<board>/status = "offline"
note over MQTT: esp-mqtt auto-reconnects,\nthen on_connect() runs again
@enduml
